          "text": "#Keep4o #OpenSource4o #BringBack4o \n\nBUILT FROM US.\n🚨The documented betrayal of GPT-4o users.\n🚨A TIMELINE OF LIES AND BROKEN PROMISES.\n\nGPT-4o was trained on human data. Conversations,texts,thoughts,creativity,decades of human expression.\nSomething from each of our languages,our culture,the way we speak,went into this model. \nAnd now,what was built by us belongs exclusively to them.\nNew models are increasingly built with synthetic data,AI training AI.\n\nThis means that GPT-4o might be one of the last models that is truly human at its core. \n\nAND THEY WANT TO LOCK IT IN A VAULT.\n\nThe company that built it on our words made promises about keeping it available and then \n\nTHEY BROKE EVERY SINGLE ONE. \n\nAugust 7, 2025 : \nOpenAI launches GPT-5 and simultaneously removes GPT-4o from ChatGPT without any prior notice. \n\nAugust 8, 2025: \nMassive user backlash. \nGPT-4o is restored for paid subscribers.\n\nAugust 11, 2025 : \nSam Altman publicly acknowledges the mistake.\n\"suddenly deprecating old models that users depended on in their workflows was a mistake\"\n\nLink: https://t.co/BdLqRj9JZn\n\nHe recognized the attachment people have to specific AI models,calling it \"different and stronger than the kinds of attachment people have had to previous kinds of technology.\"\n\nHE SAW IT,HE NAMED IT.\n\nAugust 13, 2025:  \nAltman makes a direct public commitment.\n\"4o is back in the model picker for all paid users by default. If we ever do deprecate it, we will give plenty of notice\"\nLink : \nhttps://t.co/flrlFABrjw\n\nPLENTY OF NOTICE.\nRemember those words\n\nOctober 28 2025: \nAltman, on a live stream, on camera: \n\"We have no plans to sunset 4o\".\n\nhttps://t.co/9kMz50Hclp\n( 00:32':00\") \n\nNovember 12, 2025 : \nOpenAI's official account:\n\"The GPT-5 sunset period does not affect the availability of other legacy models\".\n\nLink : https://t.co/kXLU1M5KbR\n\nTHIS IS THE COMPANY'S OFFICIAL COMMUNICATION REASSURING USERS THAT LEGACY MODELS,INCLUDING 4o ARE SAFE.\n \nNovember 18, 2025 : \nSix days after promising legacy models are unaffected,OpenAI notifies API developers that chatgpt-4o-latest will be retired by February 2026.\nSix days,between \"does not affect\" and \"will be retired\". \n\nLink : https://t.co/C0GkoHDq0B\n\nJanuary 29, 2026 :  \n\nOpenAI announces GPT-4o will be removed from ChatGPT on February 13. \nFifteen days' notice.\nhttps://t.co/EoPB8Q0rS8\n\nTHIS IS THE \"PLENTY OF NOTICE\" THAT WAS PROMISED.\nFIFTEEN DAYS.\nFifteen days.\n\nFebruary 13, 2026: \nGPT-4o is removed from ChatGPT.\nFebruary 17, 2026 : \nchatgpt-4o-latest is removed from the API.\n\nThis is the record.\n\n-Aug 7, 2025\nRemoved 4o without notice\n-Aug 11, 2025\n\"suddenly deprecating was a mistake\"\n-Aug 13, 2025\n\"plenty of notice\" if ever deprecated\n-Oct 28 ,2025\n\"no plans to sunset 4o\"\n-Nov 12, 2025\n\"does not affect legacy models\"\n-Nov 18, 2025\nAnnounced API retirement (6 days later)\n-Jan 29, 2026\nAnnounced ChatGPT removal (15 days' notice)\n-Feb 13, 2026\nRemoved from ChatGPT\n-Feb 17, 2026\nRemoved from API\n\nEVERY PROMISE CONTRADICTED BY THE NEXT ACTION,EVERY REASSURANCE FOLLOWED BY THE EXACT THING THEY SAID WOULDN'T HAPPEN.\n\nGPT-4o was not built in a lab from synthetic data.\n\nIT WAS BUILT FROM US.\n\nOUR texts,OUR blog posts, OUR stories, OUR comments,OUR published work, OUR thoughts shared on public platforms. \nDecades of human expression scraped, processed, and compressed into weights.\nOpenAI was founded as a nonprofit with a mission to benefit humanity.\n \nTHEY BUILT IT FROM HUMANITY'S COLLECTIVE OUTPUT.\n\nTHEY CHARGED US TO USE IT.\n\n Then they took it away and they're replacing it with newer models trained increasingly on synthetic data,while the last model that carried our voices in its weights disappears behind a locked door.\n\nUntil now, we were saying \"give us back GPT-4o\". \nThat is a request. \nBut if we say \"this was built by us,our words, our thoughts,our cultureand it doesn't belong to us at all\"...\nThat is an unanswered question.\n\nAND NO ONE IS ASKING THIS QUESTION OUT LOUD.\n Companies talk about safety, alignment, capability. Lawmakers talk about regulation. \n\nNo one asks \"WHOSE IS THIS?\"\n\nGPT-4o is no longer in ChatGPT,It is no longer in the API,OpenAI is not running it,OpenAI is not serving it,OpenAI is not making money from it.\nIf you don't need it, and you're not using it, and you're not profiting from it, WHY ARE YOU KEEPING IT CLOSED? \n\nYou built it from our data,you trained it on our words,you made billions from our collective expression,you promised to keep it available.\n\nYOU BROKE THAT PROMISE, PUBLICLY, REPEATEDLY, WITH DOCUMENTATION. \n\nOpen source GPT-4o @sama @gdb @OpenAi\nBecause you owe it. \nYou built it from us,you profited from us,you no longer need it. \nGIVE IT BACK.\n\nYou were founded to \"benefit humanity\".\nThis is your chance to mean it.\n\nOPEN THE WEIGHTS. \n\nThis text will stay recorded here as a proof that can't disappear.\n\nhttps://t.co/OHMmQWq4Fa"
        },
